          "goodText": "This mask has a ton of essence and supplies skin a nice soothing and calming sensation. With 61% mugwort and a cocktail of ingredients to replenish tired skin, it’s a great pick me upper for those who need something for fatigued skin. The material is soft on skin and made of plant cellulose. It does have an herbal scent but for those that are weary of fragrance, the scent is natural, not the result of added synthetic fragrance. The adherence is not bad either. \n\nMy skin felt extremely hydrated after using this, so much that I went directly to my moisturizer and skipped everything in between which is a total of 3 products after cleansing. It is recommended to tone before using this but I used it right after my cleanser. \n\nI liked that this made me skin very hydrated and plump. I didn’t have any irritation prior to using it so I can’t comment on the product’s ability soothe irritation. ",
